<title>USA: Poe &amp; Brown Inc Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Poe &amp; Brown Inc Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTONA BEACH, Fla. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 12/31   12 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>				1996     1995	 1996	  1995</p>
<p>  TOTAL REVENUES	 $29,905  $27,026  $118,680    $106,365</p>
<p>  Net income		4,332    $3,856   $16,498     $14,799</p>
<p>  Net income per share  $0.50     $0.44     $1.90	 $1.70</p>
<p>  Wgtd avg shrs	   8,678     8,714     8,683	 8,699</p>
<p>			(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 EPS from recurring operations up 15 percent to $1.90 vs 1995 $1.65 excluding 1995 favorable tax reserve adjustment of $0.05.</p>
</text>
